
                        README for GLUT-NT Examples
                        ---------------------------

NOTES:

	o  Send all bug reports/questions to Nate Robins (narobins@es.com).

	o  To compile, first set the GLUTHOME environment variable to point
	   to where the GLUT-NT distribution is.  i.e., if you put the 
	   GLUT-NT distribution in C:\opengl\glut, do the following:
	   set GLUTHOME=C:\opengl\glut
	   second, issue the make command:
	   nmake -f Makefile.nt
	   This will make all the example programs in all the subdirectories.

	o  You can also make the "clean target" to get rid of everything
	   but the source in all the subdirectories:
	   nmake -f Makefile.nt clean

	o  See the README.nt in the GLUT-NT distribution for copyright
	   information and bugs.
